# Animations

Use Reanimated v4. Avoid React Native's built-in Animated API.

Prefer animations running on the UI thread using worklets.

Reanimated v4 requires the React Native New Architecture (Fabric).

## Entering and Exiting Animations

Use `Animated.View` with entering and exiting animations.

```tsx
import Animated, {
  FadeIn,
  FadeOut,
  LinearTransition,
} from "react-native-reanimated";

function App() {
  return (
    <Animated.View
      entering={FadeIn}
      exiting={FadeOut}
      layout={LinearTransition}
    />
  );
}
```

Predefined families:

- Fade
- Slide
- Zoom
- Bounce
- Flip
- Stretch
- Roll
- Rotate
- LightSpeed
- Pinwheel

Directional variants:

- `FadeInRight`
- `FadeInLeft`
- `FadeInUp`
- `FadeInDown`

## On-Scroll Animations

Prefer Reanimated hooks for performant scroll-driven animations.

```tsx
import Animated, {
  useAnimatedRef,
  useScrollViewOffset,
  useAnimatedStyle,
  interpolate,
} from "react-native-reanimated";

function Page() {
  const ref = useAnimatedRef();
  const scroll = useScrollViewOffset(ref);

  const style = useAnimatedStyle(() => ({
    opacity: interpolate(scroll.value, [0, 30], [0, 1], "clamp"),
  }));

  return (
    <Animated.ScrollView ref={ref}>
      <Animated.View style={style} />
    </Animated.ScrollView>
  );
}
```

## Layout Transitions

Animate layout and position changes automatically.

```tsx
import Animated, { LinearTransition } from "react-native-reanimated";

<Animated.View layout={LinearTransition}>
  {items.map((item) => (
    <Item key={item.id} {...item} />
  ))}
</Animated.View>;
```

Available transitions:

- `LinearTransition`
- `SequencedTransition`
- `FadingTransition`
- `JumpingTransition`
- `CurvedTransition`
- `EntryExitTransition`

Prefer `LinearTransition` over deprecated `Layout`.

## Customizing Animations

```tsx
<Animated.View
  entering={FadeInDown.duration(500).delay(200)}
  exiting={FadeOut.duration(300)}
/>
```

### Modifiers

```tsx
FadeIn.duration(300);

FadeIn.delay(100);

FadeIn.springify();

FadeIn.springify().damping(15).stiffness(100);

FadeIn.easing(Easing.bezier(0.25, 0.1, 0.25, 1));

FadeInDown.duration(400).delay(200).springify();
```

Do not mix:

- time-based modifiers
- spring-based modifiers

## Shared Values

Use shared values for imperative animations.

```tsx
import {
  useSharedValue,
  withSpring,
  withTiming,
  useAnimatedStyle,
} from "react-native-reanimated";

const offset = useSharedValue(0);

offset.value = withSpring(100);

offset.value = withTiming(100, {
  duration: 300,
});

const style = useAnimatedStyle(() => ({
  transform: [
    {
      translateX: offset.value,
    },
  ],
}));
```

## Gesture Animations

Combine Reanimated with Gesture Handler.

```tsx
import { Gesture, GestureDetector } from "react-native-gesture-handler";

import Animated, {
  useSharedValue,
  useAnimatedStyle,
  withSpring,
} from "react-native-reanimated";

function DraggableBox() {
  const translateX = useSharedValue(0);
  const translateY = useSharedValue(0);

  const gesture = Gesture.Pan()
    .onUpdate((e) => {
      translateX.value = e.translationX;
      translateY.value = e.translationY;
    })
    .onEnd(() => {
      translateX.value = withSpring(0);
      translateY.value = withSpring(0);
    });

  const style = useAnimatedStyle(() => ({
    transform: [
      { translateX: translateX.value },
      { translateY: translateY.value },
    ],
  }));

  return (
    <GestureDetector gesture={gesture}>
      <Animated.View style={[styles.box, style]} />
    </GestureDetector>
  );
}
```

## Keyboard Animations

Prefer animated keyboard-aware layouts.

```tsx
import Animated, {
  useAnimatedKeyboard,
  useAnimatedStyle,
} from "react-native-reanimated";

function KeyboardAwareView() {
  const keyboard = useAnimatedKeyboard();

  const style = useAnimatedStyle(() => ({
    paddingBottom: keyboard.height.value,
  }));

  return <Animated.View style={style}>{/* content */}</Animated.View>;
}
```

## Keyframe Animations

Use keyframes for multi-step animations.

```tsx
import { Keyframe, Easing } from "react-native-reanimated";

const enteringAnimation = new Keyframe({
  0: {
    opacity: 0,
    transform: [{ scale: 0.5 }, { rotate: "-45deg" }],
  },

  50: {
    opacity: 1,
    transform: [{ scale: 1.2 }, { rotate: "0deg" }],
    easing: Easing.out(Easing.quad),
  },

  100: {
    transform: [{ scale: 1 }, { rotate: "0deg" }],
  },
});

<Animated.View entering={enteringAnimation.duration(600)} />;
```

Rules:

- Keyframe `0` is required
- Keep transform order consistent
- Avoid easing on keyframe `0`

## Animated Lists

Use animated FlatLists for layout changes.

```tsx
<Animated.FlatList
  data={data}
  renderItem={renderItem}
  itemLayoutAnimation={LinearTransition}
/>
```

Rules:

- Works only with single-column lists
- Prefer stable keys
- Disable with `undefined` when necessary

## LayoutAnimationConfig

Skip entering or exiting animations for subtrees.

```tsx
import { LayoutAnimationConfig } from "react-native-reanimated";

<LayoutAnimationConfig skipEntering skipExiting>
  {children}
</LayoutAnimationConfig>;
```

## Shared Element Transitions

Experimental feature.

```tsx
<Animated.Image sharedTransitionTag="hero-image" />
```

Rules:

- Requires native stack navigation
- Tags must be unique
- Not recommended for production yet

## Performance and Gotchas

- Prefer transforms over width/height animations
- Keep animations under 300ms when possible
- Prefer spring animations for natural movement
- Use `interpolate(..., "clamp")` for bounded values
- Avoid expensive work inside worklets
- Define animation builders outside components or memoize them
- Reanimated uses `nativeID` internally for entering animations
- Prefer static colors instead of `PlatformColor`
- Use `collapsable={false}` when parent removal breaks exiting animations
- Spring layout animations are not supported on web
